@startuml system_state_machine

title System State Machine

' UML 2.5.1 behaviour notation inside a state is "entry / action",
' "do / action" and "exit / action".

state InitState
InitState: entry / Initialize HAL, filesystem and display.
InitState: entry / Start all services.
InitState: entry / Prepare plugins and slot layouts.
InitState: do / Sample the user button state.
InitState: do / Process all services.
InitState: exit / Start WiFi and mDNS.
InitState: exit / Start web- and update server.

state APState
APState: entry / Set up the WiFi access point.
APState: do / Handle client requests.
APState: exit / Disconnect all WiFi connections.

state ConnectingState
ConnectingState: entry / Get the remote WiFi SSID and passphrase.
ConnectingState: do / Connect every 30 s to the remote WiFi network.
ConnectingState: do / Process all services.

state ConnectedState
ConnectedState: entry / Show the hostname.
ConnectedState: entry / Enable slot routing on the display.
ConnectedState: do / Handle client requests.
ConnectedState: do / Process all services.
ConnectedState: exit / Disconnect all WiFi connections.

state IdleState
IdleState: do / Wait for a manual reset.

state ErrorState
ErrorState: entry / Show the error message on the display.
ErrorState: entry / Stop all services.
ErrorState: do / Wait for a button press to restart.

state RestartState
RestartState: entry / Stop all services.
RestartState: entry / Unmount the filesystem.
RestartState: do / Restart.

[*] --> InitState: Power up

InitState --> APState: [button pressed] /\nset WiFi access point mode
InitState --> ConnectingState: [button released] /\nset WiFi station mode
InitState --> ErrorState: [initialization failed]

APState --> ErrorState: [failed to start\nthe WiFi access point]
APState --> RestartState: [restart requested\nvia captive portal]

ConnectingState --> IdleState: [remote WiFi SSID or\npassphrase missing]
ConnectingState --> ConnectedState: [connection successfully established]

ConnectedState --> ConnectingState: [connection lost]
ConnectedState --> RestartState: [restart requested]

ErrorState --> RestartState: [any button pressed]

IdleState --> [*]: [restart]
RestartState --> [*]: [restart]

@enduml
